description.narrative:
The Project’s goal is to advance the Development Phase of Poltavska WPP by conducting 
geological surveys and preparing comprehensive design documentationby preparing 
comprehensive and the conduct of geological surveys . The successful implementation of this 
stage will ensure safe, reliable, economically efficient and well-justified design of the wind power 
plant, as well as its further stable operation, namely:
 availability of an assessment of the engineering and geological conditions of the site and 
conclusions regarding the optimal parameters for the construction of the wind power plant 
to ensure the stability of its structures;
 availability of a set of specialized design documents, which serves as the basis for obtaining 
permitting documents confirming the project’s compliance with current legislative and 
regulatory requirements, as well as for the subsequent issuance of the construction 
permit. The planned main product of the Project (the Outputs) will be part of the development* set of 
design documentation for the Poltavska WPP, including:, but not limited:
- General data. General layout and transport;
- Technological part;
- Architectural and civil construction solutions;
- Engineering Systems;
Construction organization project;
- Fire protection;. Engineering and technical measures of civil protection;
Cost estimate documentation;
- Verification of design documentation;
- Geological surveyReports on engineering and geological survey
